      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a search for a new COO for one of our global clients. We're trying to narrow down the profile for what actually constitutes \"executive presence\" and \"commanding authority\" at the C-suite level. Can you give me a breakdown of the key personality traits and communication styles we should be looking for in a top-tier candidate?",
